        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-gray-50 py-12 md:py-16">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 text-center mb-8">What our customers say</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      ${[
        { name: 'Sarah K.', role: 'Marketing Manager', text: 'The business plan template saved me at least 30 hours of work. Clean, professional, and exactly what I needed for our investor pitch.' },
        { name: 'James R.', role: 'Freelance Designer', text: 'I have purchased four products so far and each one has been excellent quality. The financial dashboard alone paid for itself within the first week.' },
        { name: 'Maria L.', role: 'Startup Founder', text: 'Finally a store that sells business tools that actually work. No fluff, just practical frameworks we use daily.' }
      ].map(t => '<div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5">' +
        '<div class="flex items-center gap-0.5 mb-3">' + Array(5).fill('<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>').join('') + '</div>' +
        '<p class="text-gray-600 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-4">"' + t.text + '"</p>' +
        '<div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">' +
          '<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500">' + t.name.split(' ').map(w => w[0]).join('') + '</div>' +
          '<div><p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-900">' + t.name + '</p><p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400">' + t.role + '</p></div>' +
        '</div>' +
      '</div>').join('')}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="faq" class="py-12 md:py-16 scroll-mt-16">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-8">Everything you need to know about our products and services.</p>
    <div class="space-y-2">
      ${[
        { q: 'What payment methods do you accept?', a: 'We accept all major credit and debit cards including Visa, Mastercard, and American Express through our secure Stripe payment gateway. Apple Pay and Google Pay are also supported.' },
        { q: 'How do I receive my products?', a: 'All products are delivered digitally. After payment, you will receive immediate access to download your purchased items. A confirmation email with download links is sent within minutes.' },
        { q: 'Can I get a refund?', a: 'Due to the digital nature of our products, all sales are final. If you experience technical issues or the product does not match its description, please contact our support team within 48 hours.' },
        { q: 'Is my payment secure?', a: 'All payment processing is handled by Stripe, PCI-DSS Level 1 certified. Your card details are encrypted with 256-bit SSL and never stored on our servers.' },
        { q: 'Can I use products commercially?', a: 'Yes. All products include a commercial license for personal and business use. The only restriction is redistribution or resale of the original files.' },
        { q: 'Do you offer bulk discounts?', a: 'Yes, we offer special pricing for teams and organizations. Contact us for a custom quote.' },
        { q: 'Do products include updates?', a: 'Yes, all purchases include lifetime access to future updates at no additional cost.' },
        { q: 'What file formats are included?', a: 'Products typically include PDF, XLSX, DOCX, and/or PPTX formats. Specific formats are listed on each product page.' }
      ].map(item => '<details class="group bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">' +
        '<summary class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3.5 cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm hover:text-primary transition">' +
          '<span class="pr-4">' + item.q + '</span>' +
          '<svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>' +
        '</summary>' +
        '<div class="px-4 pb-3.5 text-gray-500 text-xs leading-relaxed border-t border-gray-100 pt-3">' + item.a + '</div>' +
      '</details>').join('')}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

